From 1036d598e7042aaafb61bae99354e334c209b3e5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Maxime=20M=C3=A9r=C3=A9?= <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Mar 2026 15:13:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: defconfig: enable UIO support for shared memory
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Enable the UIO core and the generic platform IRQ UIO driver in the
arm64 defconfig.

These drivers are required to allow userspace access to a shared memory
region through a UIO device in M33TDCID flavor.

Change-Id: Id850e28fd4ab4e30b53b0727903ace6fd289c647
Signed-off-by: Maxime Méré <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/547446
Reviewed-by: Amelie DELAUNAY <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Domain-Review: Amelie DELAUNAY <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/572028
---
 arch/arm64/configs/fragment-02-defconfig-addons.config | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

--- a/arch/arm64/configs/fragment-02-defconfig-addons.config
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/fragment-02-defconfig-addons.config
@@ -105,6 +105,8 @@ CONFIG_TYPEC_ADC=m
 CONFIG_TYPEC_UCPD_STM32=m
 CONFIG_UBIFS_FS=y
 CONFIG_UCSI_STM32G0=m
+CONFIG_UIO=m
+CONFIG_UIO_PDRV_GENIRQ=m
 CONFIG_USB_CONFIGFS_F_UVC=y
 CONFIG_USB_DWC2=m
 CONFIG_USB_HIDDEV=y
